The day has finally arrived.

14:59.960 --> 15:02.360
The Wild Deer of Hino, Shikanoko Noko,

15:02.360 --> 15:05.090
and Nara's official mascot 
character, Sento-kun,

15:05.090 --> 15:07.840
<b>Sento-kun vs Shikanoko Noko Battle!</b>

15:05.470 --> 15:08.290
will be competing to see who is the 
best deer local mascot character.

15:08.290 --> 15:11.230
Our commentator today will be the 
leading expert on Deer's Den research,

15:11.230 --> 15:14.030
Miura John-san.

15:14.030 --> 15:15.850
Hello. I'm Miura.

15:16.570 --> 15:21.610
I've heard that Nokotan spent a week 
undergoing rigorous training for this battle.

15:21.610 --> 15:23.610
Miura-san, what are your thoughts on that?

15:23.610 --> 15:26.360
It's been 1,300 years for Sento-kun.

15:27.130 --> 15:30.400
Are you saying that since Sento-kun 
is a mascot that was born on

15:30.400 --> 15:33.660
the 1300th anniversary of when the capital 
moved to Nara, he packs more of a punch?

15:33.660 --> 15:35.280
Precisely.

15:35.280 --> 15:38.620
It'll be interesting to see 
how this battle plays out.

15:39.260 --> 15:41.340
And now, here come our fighters.

15:41.340 --> 15:47.290
From Hinominami High 
Class 3-B, Shikanoko Noko!

15:47.300 --> 15:48.510
<b>Hinominami</b>

15:58.130 --> 15:59.510
Notsu!

15:59.890 --> 16:02.890
And here comes Sento-kun!

16:04.420 --> 16:05.900
Sento-kun!

16:07.410 --> 16:08.900
Sento-kun!

16:11.030 --> 16:13.120
Sento-kun!

16:25.170 --> 16:28.110
<i>Sento-kun knows</i>

16:28.110 --> 16:31.110
<i>Sento-kun knows</i>

16:31.110 --> 16:34.300
<i>Sento-kun knows</i>

16:34.300 --> 16:39.060
<i>Let's connect to the future</i>

16:39.060 --> 16:41.310
<i>With Heijo-kyo!</i>

16:50.250 --> 16:53.370
Sento-kun!

16:52.990 --> 17:01.370
<b>Hinominami</b>

16:53.370 --> 16:56.930
Well, we definitely lost on entrance hype.

16:56.930 --> 16:58.980
He's one of the most famous 
local mascots, after all.

16:58.980 --> 17:01.370
Sh-Sh-She just needs to win the match!

17:01.750 --> 17:03.000
Fighters to the center!

17:03.240 --> 17:05.600
<i>Wait, why am I even refereeing this?</i>

17:05.600 --> 17:08.250
<i>It's the final episode, 
so it's all hands on deck.</i>

17:08.250 --> 17:11.790
Er... Attacking with weapons is forbidden.

17:11.790 --> 17:12.510
That is all!

17:12.510 --> 17:16.010
I'll show you the results 
of my training, Sento-kun!

17:16.270 --> 17:18.760
All eyes are on this first round!

17:19.730 --> 17:21.890
Go, Shikanoko!

17:25.730 --> 17:29.610
Ah, I see Sento-kun's adopting the style 
of the Japanese national sport, sumo.

17:29.850 --> 17:31.270
Give me a break!

17:36.940 --> 17:39.450
Sento-kun's definitely on the defensive!

17:39.450 --> 17:42.450
That's it! Keep it up, Shikanoko!

17:42.450 --> 17:44.200
I'll go ahead and end it for—

18:04.740 --> 18:06.260
Shikanoko!

18:06.260 --> 18:08.770
They just got started, Onee-chan.

18:08.770 --> 18:12.110
In rice production terms, 
they've just watered the field.

18:12.380 --> 18:15.110
<b>Round 1 Over</b>

18:13.870 --> 18:15.650
And there's the bell.

18:15.650 --> 18:18.760
Sento-kun totally dominated the first round.

18:18.760 --> 18:20.120
That was brilliant.

18:21.920 --> 18:23.990
You okay, Shikanoko?

18:23.990 --> 18:28.480
You did well, but the 
enemy was just too strong.

18:28.990 --> 18:29.860
Koshitan.

18:30.740 --> 18:33.500
Promise me you won't throw 
in the towel, no matter what.

18:34.610 --> 18:35.590
I'm...

18:35.920 --> 18:37.850
I'm definitely going to win!

18:38.700 --> 18:39.700
Believe in me!

18:41.040 --> 18:42.280
Shikanoko...

18:46.040 --> 18:48.500
With that, we begin round 2.

18:59.590 --> 19:00.530
Shikanoko?

19:02.600 --> 19:05.880
Now, let's have a real 
deer fight with no rules!

19:05.880 --> 19:08.040
I was a fool to believe in you!

19:08.300 --> 19:10.500
Oh, this is definitely not allowed!

19:10.500 --> 19:12.810
This high school girl is pretty amazing.

19:13.140 --> 19:15.420
She completely threw away her deer identity.

19:17.560 --> 19:20.050
All that matters in the end 
is who wins! That's all!

19:20.050 --> 19:23.760
You can lose already! You're going 
to shame the Deer Club by cheating!

19:23.760 --> 19:25.620
But isn't that the good part?

19:25.620 --> 19:26.810
Huh? It is?

19:26.810 --> 19:30.850
Wow, looks like our leading expert 
has accepted the cheating!

19:34.130 --> 19:36.130
<b>Round 2 Over</b>

19:36.130 --> 19:38.130
<b>Round 3 Over</b>

19:36.130 --> 19:38.130
<b>Bribe Failed</b>

19:38.130 --> 19:39.990
<b>Round 4 Over</b>

19:40.320 --> 19:41.790
Let's just end this.

19:41.790 --> 19:43.740
You toughed it out to the final round.

19:44.160 --> 19:46.490
I'll at least acknowledge your tenacity.

19:46.710 --> 19:47.790
Koshitan...

19:47.790 --> 19:50.370
The Deer Club will never disband.

19:50.860 --> 19:52.120
You...

19:52.480 --> 19:57.130
I met you, Koshitan, and then 
I met the others, so I... I...

19:57.480 --> 19:59.400
Seeing it all flash before our eyes,

19:59.400 --> 20:04.640
I can't help but wonder if anything good 
came out of meeting you, but...

20:05.170 --> 20:06.970
Go, Shikanoko!

20:06.970 --> 20:09.020
No, Nokotan!

20:09.020 --> 20:11.770
Koshitan!

20:12.590 --> 20:14.770
Now for the final round.

20:15.120 --> 20:18.020
Deer Fist Final Technique!

20:18.020 --> 20:19.860
Final technique?

20:19.860 --> 20:21.150
Not the Self-Shattering—

20:21.150 --> 20:23.410
Deer Copter!

20:23.410 --> 20:25.370
What the hell kinda final technique is that?!

20:26.000 --> 20:26.910
She flew?

20:26.910 --> 20:30.470
Wait! Is that how you got stuck in 
the damn power lines in episode 1?

20:30.470 --> 20:32.780
Hey! They followed through 
on the foreshadowing!

20:32.780 --> 20:35.430
They sure are doing whatever they want, 
since it's the last episode.

20:37.670 --> 20:42.280
Even you can't do anything if I'm 
attacking from the sky, Sento-kun!

20:42.280 --> 20:43.680
Antler bombs!

20:43.680 --> 20:44.180
Take this.

20:44.180 --> 20:45.270
Wait, what?!

20:46.800 --> 20:48.430
Take that and that.

20:52.310 --> 20:54.290
Hey, stop that, Shikanoko!

20:54.290 --> 20:55.710
You're definitely going too fa—

20:57.440 --> 21:00.270
N-No one could've predicted 
this turn of events!

21:02.070 --> 21:02.980
Notsu!

21:04.570 --> 21:05.450
Notsu!

21:07.130 --> 21:07.950
Notsu!

21:34.420 --> 21:35.250
Ow.

21:37.490 --> 21:39.650
And the match has ended!

21:39.650 --> 21:41.320
The winner is Sento-kun!

21:44.900 --> 21:46.720
You're just so...

21:47.120 --> 21:49.450
Well, I guess you did your best.

21:49.450 --> 21:50.700
Koshitan...

21:51.010 --> 21:52.950
All right, it's time to interview the winner.

21:53.180 --> 21:56.280
Ah, but Sento-kun is a local 
mascot that doesn't talk.

21:56.660 --> 21:59.910
Welp, I guess we're 
interviewing the loser instead.

21:59.910 --> 22:01.040
Seriously?

22:02.570 --> 22:08.180
Everyone... When I got here today, 
the only thought on my mind was to win.

22:08.650 --> 22:12.560
All I could think about was 
escaping from Deer's Den.

22:13.200 --> 22:18.470
But as I was fighting Sento-kun, 
I felt a tremendous change in my heart.

22:19.470 --> 22:21.690
I realized that winning 
or losing doesn't matter!

22:21.690 --> 22:25.620
What's important is to give 
one's all during the match!

22:26.190 --> 22:30.370
Which means that Sento-kun 
and I are both winners!

22:30.370 --> 22:31.660
Now hold on a sec!

22:31.660 --> 22:33.740
You've got some nerve 
after all the cheating—

22:35.020 --> 22:37.760
I'm so moved! You're both winners!

22:37.760 --> 22:40.700
Miura-san, you're not right in the head!

22:41.620 --> 22:43.420
And Sento-kun, you're way too accepting!

22:45.960 --> 22:49.770
<i>A great enemy has challenged you</i>

22:50.180 --> 22:53.940
<i>So we're gonna shake any fear out of you</i>

22:50.910 --> 22:51.820
Notsu!

22:52.680 --> 22:56.610
What?! Why are you all 
so moved by that speech?!

22:54.370 --> 22:58.210
<i>It'll probably be rough sometimes</i>

22:56.610 --> 23:00.460
Well, whatever. Now the Deer Club 
doesn't have to be disbanded.

22:58.600 --> 23:02.070
<i>I'm sure you'll want to cry sometimes</i>

23:00.460 --> 23:03.940
Bashame is glad that she 
can continue making her rice.

23:02.070 --> 23:03.020
<i>But...</i>

23:03.020 --> 23:07.310
<i>You are not alone</i>

23:03.940 --> 23:05.290
Koshitan!

23:05.800 --> 23:07.670
I won, just like I promised!

23:07.310 --> 23:10.200
<i>This hellish training</i>

23:07.670 --> 23:09.700
Oh, whatever already.

23:09.700 --> 23:12.700
I hope you'll keep taking care of me.

23:10.200 --> 23:17.700
<i>You'll get through it and take 
back the spirit that you've lost</i>

23:12.700 --> 23:17.700
W-Well, I guess I gotta, right?

23:18.330 --> 23:22.570
<i>You are a wild deer</i>

23:19.370 --> 23:29.720
Nokotan! Koshitan! Nokotan! Koshitan!

23:22.570 --> 23:26.720
<i>You are a wild deer</i>

23:26.720 --> 23:30.590
<i>You are the best</i>

23:31.420 --> 23:33.600
<i>Vermin in Japan</i>
